# Custom tab

This folder is a Cadencr custom tab: a web app Cadencr loads into a sandboxed
tab on a conversation page. **Read `INSTRUCTION.md` before changing anything.**

- Work only inside this folder. Never edit Cadencr itself to make the tab work;
  if the tab needs something the SDK does not offer, say so.
- Run `npm run build` after changes and fix every error it reports.
- Use `@cadencr/tab-kit` components and theme tokens; never hardcode colors.
